<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>出版物 |皮尤研究中心</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/publications/</link><description>塑造您世界的数字、事实和趋势</description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 16:12:34 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>家庭生活中的女性、工作和护理</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/social-trends/2026/10/22/women-work-and-caregiving-through-the-arc-of-family-life/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/10/ST_26.10.22_AspenGender_featured@2x.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;在美国，性别、工作和照顾在家庭生活中常常交织在一起。大多数有 18 岁以下子女的父母都有工作。随着人口老龄化，越来越多的美国人正在照顾年老的父母。事实上，许多美国成年人夹在两种角色之间，既支持孩子又支持父母。什么时候 […]&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 16:12:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/social-trends/2026/10/22/women-work-and-caregiving-through-the-arc-of-family-life/</guid></item><item><title>在人工智能相关的职业中，男性的就业增长速度高于女性</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/10/22/men-are-experiencing-more-job-growth-than-women-in-ai-exposed-occupations/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/10/ST_26.10.22_AspenGender_featured@2x_c7d5fb.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;在最受人工智能影响的职业中，男性就业增长速度快于女性，这一差距主要是由没有学士学位的工人造成的。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 16:12:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/10/22/men-are-experiencing-more-job-growth-than-women-in-ai-exposed-occupations/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普第二任期内司法任命步伐放缓</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/10/21/pace-of-trumps-judicial-appointments-has-slowed-in-his-second-term/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/10/SR_26.10.21_judicial-appointments_crop.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;特朗普总统在本届任期内任命的联邦法官数量少于他第一届任期内的数量，而且他的步伐落后于最近几任总统。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 16:12:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/10/21/pace-of-trumps-judicial-appointments-has-slowed-in-his-second-term/</guid></item><item><title>在线社区很少关注政治，许多人表示应该保持这种状态</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/10/20/online-communities-rarely-focus-on-politics-and-many-say-it-should-stay-that-way/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/10/PI_26.1-.20_Politics-cmnty_Featured-image.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;在线社区中的大多数人在他们的首选空间中几乎看不到政治，54% 的人表示政治不属于那里。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 02:19:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/10/20/online-communities-rarely-focus-on-politics-and-many-say-it-should-stay-that-way/</guid></item><item><title>公众对美国选举抱有广泛信心——但党派人士对选举准入和安全的担忧存在分歧</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/politics/2026/10/20/broad-public-confidence-in-elections-in-the-u-s-but-partisans-differ-over-concerns-about-access-security/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/10/PP_2026.10.20_election-confidence_featured.jpg?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;大多数选民预计 2026 年中期选举会顺利进行，但共和党和民主党在非公民投票保障措施以及符合条件的公民选择投票是否可以投票方面存在分歧。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 02:19:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/politics/2026/10/20/broad-public-confidence-in-elections-in-the-u-s-but-partisans-differ-over-concerns-about-access-security/</guid></item></channel></rss>